      "claim": "Material contrast changes stiffness and damping substantially.",
      "review": "Existing compliant/stiff numerical scenarios multiply only segment Young modulus by 0.9/1.1 relative to fixed template source. Damping, density and all other fixed fields retain their original values."
    },
