      ],
      "claim": "Two same-configuration speeds define a 2.3x protocol reproducibility limit or minimum effect threshold.",
      "review": "0.09248004936026318 and 0.21090377835105664 m/s are two observed nominal results, not a statistical precision bound. They do not establish a universal resolving power, variance or threshold below which configuration effects are impossible."
